ion\n\nInstance Uniform of shader does not work properly on Compatibility Renderer! Sometimes it works while rest of the time it gets glitched out! Not sure if its about the Instance limit as being discussed in the issue #112674 .But anyway  I will drop recordings using Compatibility and Mobile renderer!\n\nCompatibility:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de3809b0-810d-4287-bff1-9acd87329572\n\nMobile:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6dfcdf0-4c3e-4696-89b9-a8aa3befab6c\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBug is set to be readily visible in the MRP below! I used ColorRect childs with shaders as custom visuals for buttons! But as soon as I turned a uniform parameter of the shader to Instance Uniform, the glitchy visuals became prominent! But this only happens in Compatibility Renderer so tester should try switching the renderer to confirm it!\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI added stripped down version of my project as MRP 👇!\n\n[Compatibility- ShaderInstance-Bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31370773/Compatibility-.ShaderInstance-Bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_